# Grandfathered legacy files for scripts/forbid_stale_future_date_fixture.sh
#
# These test files carry absolute future-dated `DateTime.utc(...)` fixtures
# written BEFORE the stale-future-date gate existed. Most anchor logic that
# never reads `BookingDisplayX.isPast` (lane layout, slot repositories,
# mapper round-trips, timezone math) so they are not live time bombs today,
# but auditing and converting ~30 files in one pass was out of scope for the
# 2026-07-20 incident fix. They are frozen here so the gate is GREEN today
# while still blocking NEW absolute future literals in every other (and every
# freshly-authored) test file under the gate's scan roots. This is a
# RATCHET: when one of these files is next meaningfully edited, convert its
# `DateTime.utc(YYYY, ...)` literal(s) to `futureBookingStart()`
# (test/helpers/booking_fixture_dates.dart) — or annotate a genuinely
# deliberate fixed instant with `// future-date-ok: <reason>` — and DELETE
# its line here. The baseline only ever shrinks. One repo-relative path per
# line; paths from EITHER scan root (test/features/booking/,
# integration_test/) are valid entries.
#
# 2026-07-21: the scan was widened to `integration_test/`. NOTHING from that
# tree was added here — its five offending sites were each judged individually
# and resolved in place (two fixtures re-anchored to `fb.bookingStartsAt`,
# three genuinely date-pinned sites annotated `// future-date-ok:`). Widening
# a guard's reach and then allow-listing whatever it finds would reproduce
# exactly the blind spot the widening existed to close.
#
# 2026-07-21 (narrow-lane audit-fix pass): the ratchet turned for the first
# time. `master_booking_card_test.dart` and `slot_time_tz_regression_test.dart`
# were both meaningfully edited by the 226dp overflow fix, so both were
# DELISTED per the rule above. Neither was converted to `futureBookingStart()`
# — that would have been the wrong conversion for both: their instants are
# deliberate wall-clock/timezone anchors that the assertions read back as
# literal strings and measured dp widths, and neither file's subject reads
# `BookingDisplayX.isPast`. They are annotated in place with
# `// future-date-ok:` instead, each stating why the instant is pinned. The
# gate DOES fire on both files without those annotations — verified by
# removing them.
#
# 2026-07-22 (mobile-qa test-writing pass): the ratchet turned again, this
# time for SEVEN files, and for the reason the header above anticipated — the
# grandfathered `DateTime.utc(2026, 7, 20, …)` instants have now ELAPSED, so
# the "not live time bombs today" clause written on 2026-07-20 had expired on
# its own terms. All seven were meaningfully edited in this pass and are
# DELISTED:
#   * booking_lane_layout_test.dart, bookings_timeline_grid_test.dart —
#     converted wholesale. Both anchor RELATIVE offsets, so each grew a
#     now-relative day helper instead of per-site literals: `_at(hour, min)`
#     over a `futureBookingStart()`-derived UTC midnight in the lane suite,
#     and `_kyivAtUtc(hour, min)` in the grid suite. The grid helper takes a
#     KYIV wall-clock hour and returns the UTC instant via `tz.TZDateTime`
#     rather than subtracting a hard-coded `-3`: the old literals silently
#     assumed Kyiv summer time, which stops being true for half the year the
#     moment the anchor day starts moving.
#   * bookings_discovery_view_reuse_test.dart,
#     master_bookings_filter_wiring_test.dart,
#     master_bookings_catalogue_staleness_test.dart,
#     booking_detail_screen_protection_test.dart,
#     widgets/booking_status_badge_test.dart — one `startAt` fixture each,
#     swapped to `futureBookingStart()`.
# `booking_detail_screen_protection_test.dart` was the one genuine live bomb
# of the seven: it pumps «Деталі запису», whose affordances gate on
# `BookingDisplayX.isPast` — the exact 2026-07-20 incident shape.
#
# Generated 2026-07-20 from the then-current corpus, immediately after fixing
# the four booking-detail specs whose expired anchor caused 16 real failures
# (booking_detail_screen_test.dart, booking_detail_interactions_test.dart,
# reschedule_in_flight_test.dart, booking_detail_provider_view_test.dart —
# NOT grandfathered; they're clean under the gate as of this commit).
